@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered : Initial State
Unregistered --> Registered : User enters details to register
Registered --> Logged In : Login details are correct
Logged In --> Done : User is done with their actions
Logged In --> Registered : User needs to re-register after initial uploads or certificate requests (optional)
Logged In --> Logged In : Incorrect login details
[*] --> Done : Final State

@enduml
